{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37453","headline":"移莎 · 唐彦谦","name":"移莎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移从杜城曲，置在小斋东。\n正是高秋里，仍兼细雨中。\n结根方迸竹，疎荫托高桐。\n苒苒齐芳草，飘飘笑断蓬。\n片时留静者，一夜响鸣蛩。\n野露通宵滴，溪烟尽日蒙。\n试才卑庾薤，求味笑周菘。\n只此霜栽好，他时赠伯翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}